    "withdrawn_claim": "The f1_plausibility rows below show the confined system BEATING the full-access baseline. That claim is WITHDRAWN. It is an artefact of comparing a range-based agent against a baseline using one crude numeric envelope, so it measures a checker difference, not a privilege difference. Read only alongside results/controlled_comparison.json, which holds the checker constant.",
